WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:39.354
Tom and Cat moved into the palace.

2
00:00:39.355 --> 00:00:50.072
Tom was the royal wizard now.

3
00:00:50.073 --> 00:00:53.547
But there was not much to do.

4
00:00:53.548 --> 00:01:20.306
"Let's go to the Royal Kitchen," Cat said.

5
00:01:20.307 --> 00:01:35.157
Cook gave Tom and Cat snacks.

6
00:01:35.158 --> 00:01:44.443
Cat chased some mice.

7
00:01:44.444 --> 00:01:50.595
But soon Tom and Cat were bored.

8
00:01:50.596 --> 00:01:59.360
"Let's go to the Royal Lab," Tom said.

9
00:01:59.361 --> 00:02:09.069
Tom mixed some potions.

10
00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:11.965
He practiced some magic spells.

11
00:02:11.966 --> 00:02:19.133
"Bring Cat a fish!" Poof!

12
00:02:19.134 --> 00:02:23.113
"That's a fishing rod!" Tom moaned.

13
00:02:23.114 --> 00:02:26.172
"What am I going to do, Cat?

14
00:02:26.173 --> 00:02:29.717
My spells never work.

15
00:02:29.718 --> 00:02:34.902
One day the king and queen will need my magic."

16
00:02:34.903 --> 00:02:39.638
Cat licked her paws.

17
00:02:39.639 --> 00:02:47.149
"You have a kind heart, Tom," she said.

18
00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:50.529
Days and weeks passed.

19
00:02:50.530 --> 00:03:00.769
Still no one at the palace needed magic.

20
00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:03.198
Bam! Bam!

21
00:03:03.199 --> 00:03:10.588
One night someone pounded hard on Tom's door.

22
00:03:10.589 --> 00:03:14.519
"Get up, Wizard!" a voice growled.

23
00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:20.331
It was Dirk. "Go to the moat at once!"

24
00:03:20.332 --> 00:03:25.718
"The moat?" Tom leaped out of bed.

25
00:03:25.719 --> 00:03:33.651
"I'm coming!"

26
00:03:33.652 --> 00:03:41.022
He put on his royal robe.

27
00:03:41.023 --> 00:03:45.856
"Where is my royal wand?" he asked.

28
00:03:45.857 --> 00:03:50.287
"It's in your hand," Cat said.

29
00:03:50.288 --> 00:03:52.625
"Oops," Tom said.

30
00:03:52.626 --> 00:03:55.515
At last Tom was ready.

31
00:03:55.516 --> 00:03:58.328
"See you later, Cat!" Tom said.

32
00:03:58.329 --> 00:04:04.929
"Good luck," Cat said.

33
00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:07.282
She went back to sleep.

34
00:04:07.283 --> 00:04:13.598
And Tom left for the moat.
